      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“而她进行在地偶像活动，\n也是源于守护原点的想法，\n是这个不可或缺的前提让她得以奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e8cb30c45a2c629a2f833f138c99a2876182c047f713702f89ba39e0ebe9e83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
