    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4322dca2f97b9d6cc2c1571",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“和北港火山熟识的店家老板，\n也非常热情地和我聊天。\n推荐的海鲜盖饭也非常好吃。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b9dc376a18b9e02fa99545c2079189bf0bec20a0f0ef2c0724d1ca03cb40c44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
