      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我要为先前的无礼道歉，\n并重新支持北港火山，\n以及苫小牧这个养育出北港火山的城市。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6864f45fc6286aed755bc208343f127cecd1dfd5b796326c3793ad1af0bde4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
