      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一连串贴文的最后，\n附上了老板面带笑容\n拿着北港火山周边的照片……",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cc1c44f2c99f24dc7c234fae09e5d11431d5a3ab511660da9f536145d10616",
